{"unit_id": "2026heshao__dsh-draft-attachments#card-zh", "repo": "2026heshao/dsh-draft-attachments", "commit": "f285e67bab926ee3083ee7b3858aa28a6092ec8a", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-draft-attachments 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的草稿附件持久化插件。它在 conversation.input.dock 注册会话级不可见组件，监听输入态附件变化，将附件文件字节及元数据按会话写入浏览器 IndexedDB，并在输入区重新挂载且当前没有附件时通过官方 createDrafts 与 addAttachments 接口恢复。它还能同步附件删除和发送后的清空状态，避免已发送的附件再次出现。单附件限制为 30 MB；适合需要切换页面或会话后继续编辑未发送图片、文件的用户。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:43-52", "lib/client.js:125-260"]}
{"unit_id": "2026heshao__dsh-draft-attachments#card-en", "repo": "2026heshao/dsh-draft-attachments", "commit": "f285e67bab926ee3083ee7b3858aa28a6092ec8a", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-draft-attachments preserves unsent DSH web composer files. A session dock component saves attachment bytes in IndexedDB and restores them through the official draft APIs when the input area reopens empty. It syncs removals and sent files; each attachment is limited to 30 MB.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:43-52", "lib/client.js:125-260"]}
