{"unit_id": "2026heshao__dsh-draft-attachments#feature-1", "repo": "2026heshao/dsh-draft-attachments", "commit": "f285e67bab926ee3083ee7b3858aa28a6092ec8a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-draft-attachments 的功能「保存会话附件草稿」：输入态附件列表变化时，插件读取对应草稿附件并将文件字节与元数据存入 IndexedDB；变更经 300 毫秒去抖，卸载或切换会话时冲刷。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:47-100", "lib/client.js:150-197"]}
{"unit_id": "2026heshao__dsh-draft-attachments#feature-2", "repo": "2026heshao/dsh-draft-attachments", "commit": "f285e67bab926ee3083ee7b3858aa28a6092ec8a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-draft-attachments 的功能「恢复附件」：输入区挂载且没有附件时，从 IndexedDB 读取记录，通过 conversation.createDrafts 重建，再用 addAttachments 放回输入框。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:198-245"]}
{"unit_id": "2026heshao__dsh-draft-attachments#feature-3", "repo": "2026heshao/dsh-draft-attachments", "commit": "f285e67bab926ee3083ee7b3858aa28a6092ec8a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-draft-attachments 的功能「同步移除与发送清空」：附件列表变化后保存当前集合；空集合会删除该会话的持久化记录，避免手动删除或发送后的附件被再次恢复。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:90-100", "lib/client.js:247-260"]}
